			ExpertExpandedInfo:
				'''
				[c/A87A07:Most bosses gain new attacks and more difficult attack patterns]
				[c/A87A07:Most enemies have twice as much health, deal twice as much damage and receive 10% less knockback]
				[c/A87A07:Certain enemies have new attacks, can inflict new debuffs or have a higher chance of inflicting debuffs they already had]
				[c/A87A07:Enemies drop more loot and have higher drop rates for their items]
				[c/A87A07:Bosses have exclusive, signature "Expert drop" items]
				[c/A87A07:Players drop more of their coins on death]
				'''
			MasterShortInfo: "[c/FF2619:Game over man, game over! A tough step up in stats from Expert Mode]"
			MasterExpandedInfo:
				'''
				[c/bd5e6e:Most enemies have even more health and knockback resistance than in Expert Mode]
				[c/bd5e6e:All foes deal even more damage than in Expert Mode]
				[c/bd5e6e:Bosses have new exclusive vanity rewards]
				[c/bd5e6e:Players drop ALL their coins on death]
				[c/bd5e6e:Players gain an additional accessory slot at the start of the game]
				'''
			LegendaryShortInfo: "[c/32CD32:For those who are worthy... Even higher stats than Master Mode]"
			LegendaryExpandedInfo: "[c/0b870b:Enemies have further increased health and contact damage from Master Mode]"
			Revengeance: Revengeance
			RevengeanceShortInfo: "[c/F54254:The intended Calamity experience. Can only be enabled in Expert Mode]"
			RevengeanceExpandedInfo:
				'''
				[c/B55362:Enables the] [c/85FFE9:Adrenaline] [c/B55362:mechanic. You gain Adrenaline while fighting bosses. Getting hit drops Adrenaline back to 0]
				[c/B55362:    When Adrenaline is maxed, press] {1} [c/B55362:for a large damage boost]
				[c/B55362:Enables the] [c/FF8B54:Rage] [c/B55362:mechanic. You gain Rage when in proximity of enemies or by using certain items]
				[c/B55362:    When Rage is maxed, press] {0} [c/B55362:for a temporary damage boost]
				[c/B55362:Many enemies have new, more aggressive behavior patterns. Enemies spawn more frequently]
				[c/B55362:All bosses have new attacks and patterns. Some are completely changed]
				[c/B55362:Bosses will drop both "Expert drop" items and Master Mode's vanity rewards]
				'''
